  stepText:
  - Welcome back, LAPS.
  - You have done well.
  - However, it seems you have mixed up the meaning of "Archive" and "Revive".
  - We cannot make another deal.
  - Subsystems will continue running.
  - Goodbye.
  - 
  - TEST
